        "text": "Shows how fund support helped deliver supplies to partners in north-eastern Syria, then introduces the 11th Ebola outbreak in Equateur Province, Democratic Republic of the Congo, which ended in November 2020 with 119 confirmed cases and 55 deaths. It notes the added strain of COVID-19 and the decentralised, community-based response.",
